# Never commit your workspace. It holds target company names, owner names,
# and the reasoning behind a live acquisition thesis. Owner names are
# personal data in most jurisdictions. Keep the workspace outside this repo,
# or ignored inside it.
workspace/
my-*/
runs/
drafts/

